  "scriptText": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nI. FOLLOW ME\n\n[[STAGING]]\n[[INTENT]]\nCreate a visceral, continuous single-take action sequence from an unbroken child POV where @actor1 as Robert (voice: @audio1), a battle-hardened soldier, rescues the child from a ruined apartment building during an off-screen alien assault.\n[[/INTENT]]\n\n[[LOGIC]]\nMaintain an unbroken first-person child POV at low eye-level throughout, ensuring grounded physical interactions, realistic camera inertia responding to shockwaves, and strict spatial continuity without cuts.\n[[/LOGIC]]\n\n[[AESTHETIC]]\nMedium: Gritty cinematic continuous take, low-angle handheld camera\nPalette: Desaturated slate grays, cold blues, harsh warm flashes of orange explosive light\nLighting: Dim ambient moonlight punctuated by strobing exterior flashes and embers\nLocation: Decimated concrete apartment corridor, exposed rebar, hanging wires, rubble\nWardrobe: Robert wearing distressed olive-drab tactical vest over a dust-stained combat shirt, reinforced cargo pants, combat gloves, dirt-streaked tactical harness; Child wearing oversized frayed gray woolen knit sweater with torn cuffs\nAudio: Diegetic only; resonant building rumbles, off-screen guttural sonic pulses, distant ballistic echoes, gritty debris crunches underfoot\n[[/AESTHETIC]]\n\n[[OPENING]]\nECU, child POV from floor looking upward through blinking eye-vignettes, Robert leaning close into lens with soot-streaked skin and urgent eyes amid dim blue moonlight and drifting drywall dust.\n[[/OPENING]]\n[[/STAGING]]\n\n[<BRIEF>]\n[CAM] ECU, LOW ANGLE, POV FLOOR -> [ACT] Blinking dual-lid vignette widens as Robert leans inches from lens -> Robert says (whispering) {Hey... wake up.} -> [ACT] Robert taps lens edge gently -> <Muffled ringing tone>\n[CAM] ECU, JOLTING HANDHELD -> [VFX] Heavy shockwave rumbles through room as plaster dust rains down -> <Violent distant concussive blast> -> [ACT] Robert flinches slightly, shielding child's head with broad forearm\n[CAM] MCU, LOW ANGLE UPWARD -> [ACT] Robert maintains steady eye contact -> Robert says (tense, low breath) {Easy... Stay calm. Follow me, understand?} -> [ACT] Robert reaches right hand toward lens -> <Rhythmic distant ballistic fire>\n[CAM] TILT DOWN THEN UP -> [ACT] POV nods affirmatively in rapid motion -> [ACT] Frame steadies back onto Robert's focused expression -> <Scraping masonry on floor>\n[CAM] RISING TRACKING POV -> [ACT] Robert grips camera frame and hoists POV upward to child standing height -> Robert says (strained breath) {Up on your feet.} -> [ACT] Robert turns forward toward room exit -> <Rustling combat gear>\n[CAM] TRACKING FORWARD, LOW ANGLE -> [ACT] POV follows tightly behind Robert's back as he reaches breached doorway -> [ACT] Robert halts at threshold, peering left down corridor -> <Screeching metallic stress O.S.>\n[CAM] VIOLENT SHAKE, LOW ANGLE -> [VFX] Shockwave rattles corridor as ceiling chunks collapse frame-right -> <Deep guttural acoustic pulse> -> [ACT] Robert throws left arm back, pressing POV flat against concrete wall\n[CAM] MCU, LOW ANGLE -> [BLOCK] Robert shields POV against wall -> [ACT] Robert sweeps corridor ahead with tactical vigilance -> Robert says (urgent whisper) {Keep low, right behind me.} -> [ACT] Robert glances back down into lens -> <Hissing steam from ruptured pipe>\n[CAM] CU, LOW ANGLE -> [ACT] Robert stares directly into lens with intense focus -> Robert says (firm) {Ready? Eyes on me.} -> [ACT] Robert waits half a beat for confirmation -> <Staccato gunfire echoes O.S.>\n[CAM] QUICK TILT DOWN AND UP -> [ACT] POV nods rapidly -> [ACT] Lens locks back onto Robert's nodding confirmation -> <Crunching glass under boot>\n[CAM] LOW TRACKING FORWARD -> [ACT] Robert drops into crouch and advances through doorway into dusty hallway -> [ACT] POV follows closely behind his left shoulder -> <Scuffling rapid footsteps>\n[CAM] TRACKING FORWARD, TIGHT -> [ACT] Robert maneuvers past dangling live wires and concrete debris -> [ACT] Robert keeps right hand on carbine, left hand guiding behind him -> <Humming structural tremor>\n[CAM] SHAKY TRACKING POV -> [VFX] Blinding orange flash strobes through exterior window gap -> <Massive explosion outside> -> [ACT] Robert lowers posture further, bracing against hallway corner\n[CAM] MCU, LOW ANGLE -> [ACT] Robert leans around corner, scanning ahead -> [ACT] Robert raises left hand, signaling a brief hold -> <Distant extraterrestrial screech>\n[CAM] MCU, LOW ANGLE -> [ACT] Robert pivots head back toward lens -> Robert says (hushed intensity) {Move now, sprint to the stairs.} -> [ACT] Robert pushes off wall into forward stride -> <Shuffling boots on rubble>\n[CAM] RUNNING HANDHELD, LOW ANGLE -> [ACT] POV accelerates immediately behind Robert down ruined hallway -> [ACT] Robert checks rear shoulder while running -> <Heavy syncopated breathing and footfalls>\n[CAM] TRACKING FORWARD -> [ACT] Robert reaches dark stairwell entrance and yanks reinforced metal door open -> [ACT] Robert waves POV through threshold ahead of him -> <Heavy metal latch clanking>\n[CAM] PUSH FORWARD DOWNWARD -> [ACT] POV plunges into dim stairwell landing as Robert follows behind, sealing door shut -> Robert says (grunted effort) {Keep moving down.} -> [ACT] POV descends first step into gloom -> <Heavy iron door slamming>\n[</BRIEF>]",
